**7.1** This License remains in force until the Publisher withdraws it or replaces it with a later version.

**7.2** On termination the user shall cease using and delete copies of the Licensed Materials; the Preferences Layer and Generated Outputs may be kept, unless their content constitutes a copy or Derivative Work of the Licensed Materials, in which case it must be deleted.

